text:
This photo shows leftovers rather than a full meal. The plate holds a yellow, curry-like residue, probably a thin smear of sauce or rice. The bowl has a few green bits, likely herbs or salad remnants. There is also a Drumstick ice cream wrapper, which looks empty.

I estimated roughly 40 g of residue on the plate at about 1.5 kcal/g, which gives about 60 kcal. The bowl has about 5 g of greens, around 5 kcal. That comes to about 65 kcal and 45 g, and I rounded to 70 kcal and 50 g.

